msgid "**Channels**"
msgstr "**チャネル**"

#: src/agents/anatomy.md
msgid "**Channels** ([Channels](../channels/overview.md)): the messaging surfaces the agent answers on. When two agents share a channel, a [peer group](../channels/peer-groups.md) decides whether they can address each other."
msgstr "**チャネル** ([Channels](../channels/overview.md)): エージェントが応答するメッセージングサーフェスです。2つのエージェントがチャネルを共有する場合、[ピアグループ](../channels/peer-groups.md)が互いに通信できるかどうかを決定します。"

#: src/channels/social.md
msgid "**Channels:** entries in `channels` may include the leading `#`; ZeroClaw adds it when missing and normalizes channel names to lowercase."
