msgid "Effective changed lines are additions plus deletions after excluding docs-like files and `Cargo.lock`. Docs-like files are paths under `docs/`, Markdown or MDX files, `.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/**`, `.github/pull_request_template.md`, `.markdownlint-cli2.yaml`, and `LICENSE`. The size workflow manages only canonical no-space `size:*` labels; it does not delete legacy spaced labels as a side effect."
