#: src/plugins/index.md
msgid "Effective grants are checked separately from manifest requests. If `config_read` is denied, the host validates an empty object. Required properties make startup fail closed. When the empty object is valid, a tool omits the empty `__config` key and channel config/secret imports return `access-denied`. The canonical host field list and defaults are in the [Config reference](../reference/config.md); `zeroclaw config list` shows the live stored values."
