#: src/security/authentication.md
msgid "Every RPC connection to the daemon binds a **principal** during the `initialize` handshake, and every method call is checked against the grants the current configuration assigns that principal. This page covers the provider set, the local-user roster, permission profiles, and, most importantly, what changes for existing remote connections."
