msgid "In Slack, go to a channel and type `/invite @YourBotName`. Then send a message or @-mention the bot. Start ZeroClaw (`zeroclaw service restart` or `zeroclaw daemon`) and it should reply. If not, see [Troubleshooting](#troubleshooting)."
