#: src/architecture/config-lifecycle.md
msgid "In ZeroCode Config, confirming an alias name saves the entry before opening its fields. Cancelling the name form does not create an entry. Leaving the field editor afterward keeps the saved entry, and field edits retain their existing persistence behavior."
