#: src/sop/observability.md
msgid "In ZeroCode, open Logs and press `r` to enter a run ID; press `R` to clear the run filter. API clients can use `GET /api/logs?sop_run_id=<run-id>` and paginate with `next_cursor_line_offset` just like any other log query."
