msgid "Minimal is a runtime catalog selection. Standard `dist` still carries the compiled native adapters, so minimal alone is not binary-size evidence for [the tool extraction work](https://github.com/zeroclaw-labs/zeroclaw/issues/10998). Container, Kubernetes and Nix defaults omit `[tools]` and load full like any other configuration; set `optional = []` in them for minimal."
