#: src/architecture/decisions/ADR-018-runtime-security-and-provenance.md
msgid "No single PR should attempt to route every action, every transport, every audit sink, and every internal-turn consumer through the full target at once. Each slice must preserve existing default behavior unless that slice explicitly owns a compatibility change."
