msgid "Optional `[egress]` table carrying a `hosts` list: the destinations this plugin declares it needs, as exact hosts (`api.example.com`) or explicit suffix patterns (`*.example.com`, which matches subdomains but not the apex). It is part of the canonical manifest bytes, so it is covered when the manifest is signed and changing it requires re-signing. Invalid grammar rejects the whole manifest at discovery and at install. Absent, empty, and \"declares nothing\" are the same state."
