msgid "Rate-limit handling differs by channel. Twitch writes IRC `PRIVMSG` frames directly and has no adapter-specific limiter. If you hit persistent rate-limiting, throttle the agent's posting cadence at the source rather than relying on per-channel streaming knobs (none of these channels expose draft-update intervals; their schema is intentionally minimal)."
