#: src/architecture/decisions/ADR-016-holding-crate-exceptions.md
msgid "That combination has no answer for the ordinary case: accepted work lands on a subsystem that still lives in the holding crate, and the crate it is supposed to move to has not been built. The contract forbids the only available home, and the destination does not exist yet. Three pull requests reached that state and resolved it three different ways."
