msgid "V1 peer reply provenance is process-local. A completed live-process recipient turn must either deliver along the provenance or record a failed delivery outcome, but in-flight unbound `degrade` dispatches may be lost across crash. A durable dispatch row or durable queue is a separate follow-up, not part of this V1 decision."
