#: src/architecture/provider-routing-lifecycle.md
msgid "`ProviderDispatch` opens attribution around each provider call. `ReliableModelProvider` records a requested-versus-served fallback only after a non-streaming call succeeds or a fallback stream completes without error. Runtime and channel code can consume that task-local record to tell a user that recovery occurred."
